[{"client_msg_id":"42cdc776-c0b2-4033-b955-1cfbbf2a67f5","type":"message","user":"U022XK5866Q","text":"やっぱり表を使うのはやめようw","ts":"1637073544.251900","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"sorena","count":1,"users":["U013QL1RAPN"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"d1TI"}]},{"client_msg_id":"256f36b9-899c-49a2-acc5-526a33ed14f5","type":"message","user":"U022XK5866Q","text":"あ、でもこれだとセルのマークアップできないか？","ts":"1637073506.251600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"q+BJ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f5154e28-aea6-4b11-be13-a35b22648873","type":"message","user":"U022XK5866Q","text":"表の是非は別として、どうしても使うならPandoc's Markdown使うならRawBlockでCSV記述して\n``````{=csv}\na, b\nc, d\n``` ```\nLuaフィルタで変換するのが幸せかな？\n```function RawBlock(el)\n  if el.format ~= \"csv\" then\n    return\n  end\n  local csv = pandoc.read(el.text, \"csv\")\n  return csv.blocks\nend```","ts":"1637073485.251200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ll2O"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c4b1b882-9318-4037-97ef-c04a750c4c4e","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"画像は Vim 内で表示できないので不要ですね(ぇ","ts":"1637073374.249700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"B1kRs"}]},{"client_msg_id":"593dea4f-1452-43fd-98a6-125eb7e1df4b","type":"message","user":"U01D9BALEKU","text":"あ、リンクと画像の簡易表記は要るかw","ts":"1637073218.248100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"O+XaE"}]},{"client_msg_id":"7739d0c2-b438-4489-bb99-8d3436af0067","type":"message","user":"U01D9BALEKU","text":"もう章立てとリストだけでいいよ、という感","ts":"1637073198.247200","edited":{"user":"U01D9BALEKU","ts":"1637073365.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"wakaru","count":3,"users":["U022XK5866Q","UL6CFN8NR","UD1FQV38V"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"uvQqE"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ef28c43e-ae69-4e5b-b153-3371874af2cb","type":"message","user":"U022XK5866Q","text":"Luaフィルタやってみようかと思ったけど、今の実装だとしんどいからexampleも除去してるぜってあるのでやめた。\n\u003chttps://github.com/jgm/pandoc/issues/6569#issuecomment-665291150\u003e","ts":"1637072800.246300","thread_ts":"1637072124.244200","attachments":[{"color":"24292f","fallback":"\u003chttps://github.com/jgm/pandoc/issues/6569#issuecomment-665291150|Comment on #6569 Table constructor not documented or usable in Lua filter\u003e","id":1,"title":"\u003chttps://github.com/jgm/pandoc/issues/6569#issuecomment-665291150|Comment on #6569 Table constructor not documented or usable in Lua filter\u003e","text":"Thanks for the report.\n\n\u0026gt; I'm sure he just missed that particular example\n\nI did indeed. The example has been removed for now (see \u003chttps://github.com/jgm/pandoc/issues/6571|#6571\u003e). Handling tables in Lua filters is quite unpleasant with the current tooling, and I'd like to use the example to drive the development of something better. Converter and convenience functions like those posted by \u003chttps://github.com/kysko|@kysko\u003e seem like the way to go. Maybe we can expose `T.P.Writers.Shared.toLegacyTable` and `T.P.Builders.table` to Lua.","mrkdwn_in":["text"],"blocks":null,"footer":"\u003chttps://github.com/jgm/pandoc|jgm/pandoc\u003e","footer_icon":"https://slack.github.com/static/img/favicon-neutral.png","ts":1595971438}],"subtype":"thread_broadcast","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"uQJ"}],"root":{"client_msg_id":"850c2c8a-b86d-4b4e-a24a-28f021e83e28","type":"message","user":"U022XK5866Q","text":"こんな感じの記法にすればLuaフィルタでPandoc's Markdownにlist table輸入できそうだな……\n```::: {.list-table width=\"15 10 30\"}\n\n* - Treat\n  - Quantity\n  - Description\n* - Albatross\n  - 2.99\n  - On a stick!\n\n:::```","ts":"1637072124.244200","thread_ts":"1637072124.244200","reply_cou