.ico","from_url":"https://blog.atusy.net/2021/09/22/pandoc-partial-conversion-by-filter/","original_url":"https://blog.atusy.net/2021/09/22/pandoc-partial-conversion-by-filter/"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"T1k"}]},{"client_msg_id":"0059c6c1-32d9-4446-b961-c780f02e609c","type":"message","user":"U022XK5866Q","text":"表の定義は方言依存過ぎて……。ちなみにCommonMarkは表を定義してませんね。\n\u003chttps://spec.commonmark.org/0.30/\u003e","ts":"1637071272.235800","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"hee","count":1,"users":["U01D9BALEKU"]},{"name":"hai-small","count":1,"users":["U013QL1RAPN"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"WQW"}]},{"client_msg_id":"1ecaac06-e4d9-4a2c-b000-b3abd150bffd","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"HTMLで全部書いてMarkdownと言い張るやつ","ts":"1637071061.234800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"dlR"}]},{"client_msg_id":"8979ac74-9361-4fec-9c9f-3e68edcc8da5","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"~タグを並べれば…~","ts":"1637071036.234000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"8rM+a"}]},{"client_msg_id":"7a0d9c6c-f55b-429e-a556-1e50d19cc8cf","type":"message","user":"U01D9BALEKU","text":"いっそ表は無い方が幸せだったのでは","ts":"1637071005.233400","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"sorena","count":1,"users":["U9S4G0LJW"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"lh11"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a2800599-d137-47ee-b35d-6868545135ef","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"立てたあとにコメントでのやり取りが発生すると結局破綻するので何かのフローの入り口にするくらいの割り切りがないときつそうではある","ts":"1637070727.232900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Aig"}]},{"client_msg_id":"978802d3-0409-49e5-bfbc-65b29c6b89af","type":"message","user":"U9S4