ed-8e98-a37d5abe8f21","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"Issue Templateあるとやりやすいんですけどねー","ts":"1637064290.212400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"DR=e"}]},{"client_msg_id":"9213bb2b-7842-452a-bec8-35acc98fd165","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"ただ、うっかり八兵衛なプロジェクトだと、過去の類似issue(closeしている)が再発したりとかねw","ts":"1637064253.211900","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"totemoturai","count":1,"users":["UD1FQV38V"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"dme"}]},{"client_msg_id":"9c1416c1-74e6-4fdd-a838-9ee4e0bcc894","type":"message","user":"UD1FQV38V","text":"\u003chttps://qiita.com/wraith13/items/cd46d5eb736f6803f47c#issue%E3%82%92%E7%AB%8B%E3%81%A6%E3%82%88%E3%81%86\u003e\n\u0026gt; issueも同じです。本当に必要なissueは立てましょう。過去issueに類似したモノはないか？　関連する範囲のドキュメントには全て目を通したか？　バグ報告ならバージョン、 expected(こうなる事が期待されるが), result(こうなった), 再現環境が適切に記述されてますか？　等々抜かりが無いように慌てず慎重にissueを立てましょう。\nこれの気持ちも分かるなぁ...むずかしい","ts":"1637064208.211100","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"hai-small","count":2,"users":["U022XK5866Q","U7JL1UKKL"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"NgX"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e16d23ef-cfcc-4cdc-b55c-102deb6a6288","type":"message","user":"U022XK5866Q","text":"先の記事にもあるとおり、\n\u0026gt; 「人気プロジェクトとなると、話が全然変わってきます。」\nであって十把一絡げに\n\u0026gt; OSS プロジェクトに issue を立てる事について。「最適化するな！」と同程度に「issueを立てるな！」を守りましょう。\nってのも違うよなーと。\nじゃないとほとんどのプロジェクトは関心を持たれていることにすら気付かず消えてってしまいかねないですし。\nというわけで↓派。\n\u003chttps://twitter.com/songmu/status/1460566497462394882\u003e","ts":"1637064091.209900","attachments":[{"fallback":"\u003chttps://twitter.com/songmu|@songmu\u003e: OSSも人間の活動だからプロジェクト毎に個性がある。\nなのでOSSのお作法、みたいなものに捉われないで、それぞれのプロジェクトとどの様に関わればうまくいくのかを、個別に向き合っていく必要がある。\n世知辛いかも知れませんが、僕達の苦手な人付き合いと同じなんですよね。","id":1,"author_name":"songmu","author_subname":"@songmu","author_link":"https://twitter.com/songmu/status/1460566497462394882","author_icon":"https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/538947384420483072/5WmJP-fh_normal.jpeg","text":"OSSも人間の活動だからプロジェクト毎に個性がある。\nなのでOSSのお作法、みたいなものに捉われないで、それぞれのプロジェクトとどの様に関わればうまくいくのかを、個別に向き合っていく必要がある。\n世知辛いかも知れませんが、僕達の苦手な人付き合いと同じなんですよね。","blocks":null,"footer":"Twitter","footer_icon":"https://a.slack-edge.com/80588/img/services/twitter_pixel_snapped_32.png","ts":1637061163,"service_name":"twitter","from_url":"https://twitter.com/songmu/status/1460566497462394882","original_url":"https://twitter.com/songmu/status/1460566497462394882"}],"edited":{"user":"U022XK5866Q","ts":"1637064128.000000"},"team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"wakaru","count":3,"users":["UL6CFN8NR","U011FTGJ3SN","U8CC7MDCL"]},{"name":"hai-small","count":1,"users":["U013QL1RAPN"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"mX=V"}]},{"client_msg_id":"81d59774-6f44-46f9-998b-720f6baffd29","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"Issue なんも返事もできてないのたくさんあってすまんなの気持ち","ts":"1637061702.207000","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"wakaru","count":2,"users":["U9S4G0LJW","UQ3FVM6E9"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Mtii"}]},{"client_msg_id":"bc8d13a7-05e8-493a-8fb4-5d13b99871d7","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"はい、誰か整理する人が必要なのです","ts":"1637061501.206500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"gRJOU"}]},{"client_msg_id":"be2dd3c1-d29f-4a18-9064-9f1b2254f5d5","type":"message","user":"U013QL1RAPN","text":"もしかして、issue quality keeper (基準に達しないものはどんどん却下する人間)もいいコントリビューションなのか。","ts":"1637061088.206100","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"daiji","count":1,"users":["U022XK5866Q"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"ZMjVO"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d3dad711-70f6-47c5-b9aa-27ce399d0882","type":"message","user":"U7JL1UKKL","text":"Bram氏でさえ全てはチェックできてない。私でも無理だ","ts"